            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Beckiboo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I add about 1 cup confec sugar to the mix and thin it with a splash of milk or half and half. Make sure you bring it to room temperature before serving or it will harden back into a block of cream cheese. This is very very good! Thanks for sharing!",
            "datePublished": "2015-09-29T13:15:23.423Z"
          },
